{"type":"text","timestamp":1794343169732,"sessionID":"ses_e38dab8d8ffeqbD0B35tdn7Zzi","part":{"id":"prt_1c72feeaa001612WUKUS4j5Jpi","messageID":"msg_1c72fdb32001lTZzDAmb20YtP5","sessionID":"ses_e38dab8d8ffeqbD0B35tdn7Zzi","type":"text","text":"Built the full customer directory.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + SQLite (`./data/app.db`) with token auth (`Authorization: Bearer`), all specified endpoints, paged/filtered customer list, per-customer interaction log (newest first), duplicate-email and field validation, cascade delete, `last_contacted_at`/`interaction_count` derived from interactions, plus `/api/companies` for the filter. Serves `frontend/dist` with SPA fallback.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/src`): React + TypeScript (Vite) styled entirely with Tailwind utilities — sign-in/register screen, customer table with search, company filter and paging, customer detail with edit/delete, interaction log and log form, and forms that surface API validation/duplicate-email messages.\n\n**Verification**: backend API flows tested (auth, CRUD, validation, filters, paging, cascade delete, persistence across restart), `tsc` typecheck passes, `npm ci && npm run build` succeeds, and the gunicorn server serves the SPA, deep links, and API correctly. Also fixed the base `requirements.lock` hashing setup that would have broken the Docker pip install.","time":{"start":1794343169706,"end":1794343169708}}}
